WEBVTT

00:03:29.247 --> 00:03:31.165
I'm like, "Oh, actually, you know what?

00:03:31.207 --> 00:03:33.709
The yard here in the center
looks like it's concrete.

00:03:33.751 --> 00:03:35.294
I could work on that."

00:03:35.336 --> 00:03:38.881
"Look, JR, that's a supermax
security prison."

00:03:39.465 --> 00:03:40.633
It's called Tehachapi,

00:03:40.675 --> 00:03:43.469
it's actually in the top five
of the most violent prisons.

00:03:43.469 --> 00:03:44.929
I was like, "That will do it."

00:03:44.929 --> 00:03:46.305
The next day, we flew there.

00:03:46.764 --> 00:03:48.224
We arrived there,

00:03:48.266 --> 00:03:50.977
and of course, you know,
it's not that easy to get there.

00:03:50.977 --> 00:03:53.020
It's like fences, electric fences, walls.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:55.898
And you add more walls
and more people that check your IDs.

00:03:55.898 --> 00:03:58.901
I get all the way to the yard.

00:03:58.943 --> 00:04:02.488
And it looked like some army guy
with bulletproof jackets and heavily armed